  "Description":          "Environment Sensing Subsystem, Stage 1: one Environment Sensing Technology end to end. Acquisition is the User Agent's. CAV-SAG produces the ego Spatial Attitude; OSD-BVS describes the acquired Basic Visual Object against it and raises the Alert, which leaves the Subsystem directly for Traffic Obstacle Avoidance without waiting for integration; CAV-BED integrates the single contribution and returns the scene as the prior for the next cycle. The Module is started once and run continuously; there is no per-cycle start.",

